%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as GitHub schedule (13:23 UTC)
  participant L as Load one day job
  participant B as Binance archive
  participant V as Landing volume
  participant R as Recheck job
  participant T as Transform job
  participant P as Bronze pipeline
  participant W as SQL warehouse (dbt)
  S->>L: start, date = yesterday (UTC)
  L->>B: list USDT perpetuals, download zip + .CHECKSUM
  L->>L: verify SHA-256, unzip, gzip, atomic rename
  L->>L: stop if the day isn't fully published (nothing uploaded)
  L->>V: databricks fs cp --overwrite (up to 3 attempts), files + manifest
  L-->>R: upload succeeded (needs: load)
  R->>V: manifests of the 7 days before yesterday
  R->>B: fingerprints now (.CHECKSUM)
  R->>V: changed or new files, under new names
  R-->>T: recheck done (needs: load, recheck)
  T->>P: databricks bundle run bronze
  P->>V: Auto Loader reads only new files
  T->>W: dbt source freshness (warn 36 h, error 72 h)
  T->>W: dbt build (models, snapshot, tests)
